2 CONC ce Xi of Dongping (created 52 BC, d. 19 BC) Liu Jing (劉竟), Prince of Qinghe (created 47 BC), later Prince Ai of Zhongshan (created 44 BC, d. 35 BC) Princess Guantau Princess Guiwu, married first Zhang Lin, Marquis of Fuping and ha
2 CONC d a son, Zhang Fang; remarried to Zhao Qin, Marquis of Linping; remarried to Xue Xuan, Marquis of Gaoyang
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestry Ancestors of Emperor Xuan of Han References Book of Han, vol. 8. Zizhi Tongjian, vols. 24, 25, 26, 27. Yap, Joseph P. (2009). Wars With The Xiongnu, A Translation from Zizhi tongjian. AuthorHouse, Bloomington, Indiana, U.
