1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=16620 '''Liu Ren''' 劉仁] [16620] He was Han Gaozu's grandfather and the first Pengcheng Liu(2), although Liu(2) Yizhi [3594], in his funerary inscription for his u
2 CONC ncle, Gong [3597], identifies the "real" Pengcheng Liu(2) as beginning with the enfeoffment of Han Xuandi's son. However, the Pengcheng Liu(2) rulers of Liu(2) Song trace their ancestry to Liu(2) Bang's [16622] younger brother, Ji
