2 CONC ization in China: Volume 2. Taipei: Caves Books Ltd. 5.^ Sources of Western Zhou History: Inscribed Bronze Vessels by Edward L. Shaughnessy 6.^ Sharing the Light: Representations of Women and Virtue in Early China by Lisa Ann Raph
2 CONC als. Gong is mentioned with one woman.
