2 CONT
2 CONT 根据史学家罗香林研究孙中山先生家世源流及近100姓氏世系的总结，平均每代代差为 25-30年 为常，从公元前2070年至前1600年的 470年间应有19-17代， 应有14世没有记录。
2 CONT
2 CONT According to historian Luo Xianglin (罗香林)'s study on the origin of Sun Yat-Sen's surname clan family records and over 100 other surnames, he concluded the average difference between generations usually range from 25 to 30 years. F
2 CONC rom 2070 BC to 1600 BC, over a period of 470 years, there should have between 19 to 17 generations. Therefore there should be about 14 generations not recorded.
