1 CONT     * 1 Background, birth, and years as crown prince
1 CONT     * 2 Early reign: the young years
1 CONT     * 3 Maturity in reign and territorial expansion
1 CONT     * 4 Further territorial expansion, old age, and paranoia
1 CONT     * 5 The Crown Prince Ju revolt
1 CONT     * 6 Late reign and death
1 CONT     * 7 Legacy
